  "LEZ-08-105|E|2026-11-19": {"short":"MTM45-1 prepreg conversion (block P)","change":"Laminate system: MTM45-1 prepreg (NCAMP), M cycle (Miles, 2026-11-19): MTM45-1 / 6781 S2-glass fabric (0.0101 in cured) for skins, webs, faces and the glass caps (laid 0/90), MTM45-1 / HTS40 carbon unitape (0.0055 in) for the wing, canard, CS-spar and jut-out caps, Divinycell HT61 cores CNC-milled (the lowest density that passes), FM 300-2 for core and secondary bonds. Allowables NCAMP MH × 0.72 (6781, HTS40: mean × 0.8 × 0.9) at ETW 200 °F, BOUND until the M-cycle coupon programme (DOT/FAA/AR-03/19); cure 250 ± 10 °F for 4–6 h, ≥ 28 inHg, no post-cure; out-time ≤ 10 days, storage ≤ 0 °F. CNC core programme in place of the hot-wire templates; the steps read debulk, bag, cure."},
